    {
      "id": "claim_333b115dce01472f995fa15e662a1517",
      "statement": "Every restock (/batches), scan (/scan), and manual deduction (/deduct) appends a StockMovement row and commits it within the same request, making stock_movements an authoritative IN/OUT audit trail rather than a view derived from current totals.",
