      "id": "claim_db1b1837e2e24fc29562b278bdf078d6",
      "statement": "The frontend mirrors the expiry model: it filters batches by variety, sorts them by expiry_date, keeps only batches with remaining quantity, and derives urgency states (expired, critical, soon, fresh) from days-until-expiry.",
