      "statement": "Reports.jsx declares a REPORTS table with one entry per report endpoint; each ReportTable fetches its own endpoint independently on mount with its own loading/error state, so the four report requests fire in parallel as separate fetches with no shared loading, no batching, and no 10-second polling.",
