      "id": "claim_cd11a5ce128944b39185dbc08bfbd032",
      "statement": "StockMovement defines its datetime column as received_at in models.py, but /reports/last7 raw SQL and scripts/low_stock.py both reference a non-existent timestamp (s.timestamp in the report SQL and StockMovement.timestamp in the low-stock ORM filter), a naming discrepancy that will cause a runtime error unless the column or attribute is reconciled to received_at.",
